# Gundabad Opportunist: the permission lasts "until the end of your next turn" and no longer. The Forest exiled on turn 1 is
# not played on turn 3 (Bot1 plays an Island from its hand instead), and on turn 5, with a land drop open, Bot1 may no longer
# play it from exile (CR 514.2); the Island played right after is the control that the drop was open.

